that's letting you down,
with the people above you.

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:25.570
What most people do, it's amazing to me,

00:10:25.570 --> 00:10:28.000
I watch people who have been
in my company for seven years

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:31.170
and I have a real relationship
with, but they would rather

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:34.630
vent on Slack or in the boys' bathroom

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:37.070
than come and talk to me for
five minutes to address it.

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:38.670
People really enjoy complaining.

00:10:40.170 --> 00:10:43.770
Because a lot of people
actually are fascinated,

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:47.090
people really enjoy the crutch
of having something to blame.

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:49.190
That's the best part of being an employee.

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:54.170
What sucks about entrepreneurship
is it's your fault.

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:58.050
Every single problem at
VaynerMedia is 100% my fault.

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:01.226
I've empowered the people,
or I myself am doing it.

00:11:01.226 --> 00:11:02.300
(audience laughs)

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:04.120
The best part of all of you sitting here

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:06.147
is you can blame someone.

00:11:06.147 --> 00:11:07.440
(audience laughs)

00:11:07.440 --> 00:11:08.533
It's fuckin' fun!

00:11:09.550 --> 00:11:11.280
It's why we love having parents.

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:13.199
You blame them for your fucked-up shit.

00:11:13.199 --> 00:11:14.050
(audience laughs)

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:18.130
So I think it's about communication,

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:20.900
and then you're at the, you
know, one of the reasons

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:23.620
I think Vayner has had
success, at its end,

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:26.620
I'm genuinely not short-term
financially motivated,

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:29.980
and I genuinely view myself as the logo.

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:31.990
And I don't care if
somebody's been with me

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:33.930
for 10 years or one day.

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:35.210
As a matter of fact, I would argue

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:38.450
that every time there's a
beef between somebody senior

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:40.910
and somebody underneath,
I default subconsciously

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:42.710
to believe in the person underneath.

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:44.833
'Cause I believe the person
above has more to lose.

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:48.300
It's not always true, obviously,

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:50.330
I've gone millions of times in both ways.

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:53.860
But a lot of companies just
are a top-down organization.

00:11:53.860 --> 00:11:54.693
- Thank you so much.

00:11:54.693 --> 00:11:55.600
(audience applauds)

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:56.984
- Thank you, thank you, guys.

00:11:56.984 --> 00:12:01.984
(audience applauds)
(thoughtful hip-hop music)

